    h1: 'Your brand. My engineering.',
    lede: "Four white-label offers — AI-visibility audits, Astro builds, RAG assistants, self-hosted AI deployments — delivered unbranded under your agency's name, at the same published prices as the public service ladder. I never contact your client on my own initiative, before, during or after the work; the relationship, the margin and the credit are yours end to end.",
    buy: {
      heading: 'What you are actually buying',
      intro: 'Four deliverables, each already sold on this site under my own name:',
      items: [
        {
          title: 'AI-visibility (GEO) audits',
