      'I invoice you directly, never your client, on the same milestone schedule as every rung — typically 30/40/30; what and when you invoice your client stays entirely yours to decide. Your margin is whatever you add on top — I never quote a number to your client, and never see the number you quote them, so there is never a competing figure in the room.',
