            'GMT+4 — my working afternoon is your morning across the EU and UK, a real overlap window every business day, before anything has to wait until tomorrow.',
        },
        {
          label: 'Process',
          value:
            'Async-first — briefs and deliverables move as documents, replies land in writing within one business day, and calls happen when they earn a slot on the schedule.',
